<http://w3id.org/glosis/model/codelists/results/stickinessValueCode-SST> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "After pressure, soil material adheres to both thumb and finger but comes off one or the other rather cleanly. It is not appreciably stretched when the digits are separated." .
