<http://w3id.org/glosis/model/codelists/results/structureGradeValueCode-MO> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Moderate"@en .
# 
# http://w3id.org/glosis/model/codelists/results/structureGradeValueCode-MS
